# E11 -- replication on seeds 5-9 of the three systems that matter (E0, E10_base_16ep,
# E10_fullq_16ep), plus the final system. Every setting identical to the originals;
# input, context and epochs are on each lane line. Plan: reports/02_experiment_log.md §E11.

# unchanged from E0 / E10
--model microsoft/deberta-v3-large
--batch-size 16
--lr 1e-5
--head-lr 1e-4
--llrd 0.95
--loss ce

# operational (1024-token runs ~15-17 GB; 512-token ~9 GB)
--max-vram-gb 18
--save-model
--push-to-hub
